#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:6
msgid "Linux Environment Setup"
msgstr "Linux 环境搭建"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:8
msgid ""
"This document details the complete steps to set up the UniSDK development"
" environment on a Linux system (using Ubuntu as an example)."
msgstr ""
"本文档详细介绍了在 Linux 系统（以 Ubuntu 为例）上搭建 UniSDK 开发环境的完整步骤。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:10
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:12
msgid "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or higher"
msgstr "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 或更高版本"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:13
msgid "At least 4 GB RAM, 8 GB+ recommended"
msgstr "至少 4 GB RAM，建议 8 GB 以上"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:14
msgid "Sufficient disk space (SDK + toolchain requires approximately 2 GB)"
msgstr "充足的磁盘空间（SDK + 工具链约需 2 GB）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:16
msgid "Install System Dependencies"
msgstr "安装系统依赖"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:24
msgid "Verify installation:"
msgstr "验证安装："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:33
msgid "Set Up Python Virtual Environment"
msgstr "搭建 Python 虚拟环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:50
msgid ""
"!!! tip \"Recommendation\"     Remember to activate the virtual "
"environment before each development session:     ```bash     source "
".venv/bin/activate     ```"
msgstr ""
"!!! tip \"建议\"     每次开发前记得激活虚拟环境：     ```bash     source "
".venv/bin/activate     ```"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:56
msgid "Initialize West"
msgstr "初始化 West"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"!!! warning \"Common Issue: already initialized\"     If you encounter "
"the `already initialized in {path}, aborting.` error:     ```bash     "
"unset ZEPHYR_BASE     west init -l     ```"
msgstr ""
"!!! warning \"常见问题：already initialized\"     如果遇到 `already initialized in {path}, aborting.` 错误：     ```bash     "
"unset ZEPHYR_BASE     west init -l     ```"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:73
msgid "Configure Toolchain"
msgstr "配置工具链"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:75
msgid "Download the Telink RISC-V toolchain (contact the Telink team for access)"
msgstr "下载 Telink RISC-V 工具链（请联系 Telink 团队获取）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:76
msgid "Extract the toolchain to a designated directory:"
msgstr "将工具链解压到指定目录："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:81
msgid ""
"Set the environment variable (recommend adding to `~/.bashrc` or "
"`~/.zshrc`):"
msgstr ""
"设置环境变量（建议添加到 `~/.bashrc` 或 `~/.zshrc`）："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:86
msgid "Configure BDT Tool (Optional)"
msgstr "配置 BDT 工具（可选）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:88
msgid "If you need to use the `west tl-bdt` command for flashing and debugging:"
msgstr "如果需要使用 `west tl-bdt` 命令进行烧录和调试："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:98
msgid "Verify Environment"
msgstr "验证环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_linux.md:108
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "下一步"

